  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WGG- Research and Documentation in Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The strategy of research and documentation is integral to the learning and evidence building agenda of the WGG Consortium and its country-level strategic partners. There are significant programmatic components of the consortium wide joint activities as part of global and regional advocacy efforts.</narrative>
  </description>
