      <location ref="Bangladesh"></location>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">On 11th March 2024 at 05:30 PM Women with Disabilities Development Foundation &#x2013; WDDF Organized a Television talk show titled &apos;Inclusion and Investment in Women with Disabilities in Sustainable Economic Development&apos; was held on RTV on the occasion of International Women&apos;s Day -2024.  Foundation (WDDF) developing a research document on SGBV and Political Participation of Women and Girls with Disabilities. Through this project 1000 women and men will be aware to prevent violence against women and girls with disabilities.</narrative>
      </comment>
