     <actual value="5">
      <location ref="Bangladesh"></location>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">One of the Bangladesh partner produced the results of 3 Focus Group Discussions with WWDs (in Borishal, Dinajpur, and Gazipur) on SGBV and political participation. This will support the research on WWDs and SGBV.A social media campaign was launched  by another partner on introducing WGG and &apos;Sexual and Gender-Based Violence in the Workplace&#x2019; consisting of videos and messages. This campaign led to a live-streamed webinar in May 2022, which was attended by 65 persons from UN Bodies; Embassies; and other stakeholders.On the occasion of 16 days of Activism, a joint activity by Bangladesh strategic partners was held to share research findings on the topic of &apos;Making education curriculum inclusive and gender-sensitive to prevent SGBV&apos;.</narrative>
      </comment>
